## Anti-Pattern Quick Reference (Developer-Specific)

| ❌ Anti-Pattern | Why | ✅ Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `@GeneratedValue(IDENTITY)` | Disables Hibernate batching | UUID with `GenerationType.AUTO` |
| `@Transactional` without retry wrapper | 40001 not retried | Add AOP aspect or `@Retryable` |
| Multi-statement explicit transaction for atomic ops | Multiple round-trips, 40001-prone | Single-statement CTE |
| `FetchType.EAGER` on associations | N+1 queries, unbounded data | Default to LAZY, use JOIN FETCH |
| `spring.jpa.open-in-view=true` (OSIV) | Unpredictable lazy loading | Disable, fetch in service layer |
| External API call inside `@Transactional` | Transaction held open for seconds | Call API outside transaction |
| Missing `reWriteBatchedInserts=true` | Each INSERT is separate round-trip | Set on DataSource properties |
| `hibernate.ddl-auto=update` in production | Wraps DDL in transactions | Use Flyway/Liquibase |
| Overlapping key ranges in parallel DML | 40001 serialization failures | Partition into disjoint ranges |
